## DELETE / TRUNCATE / DROP

```sql
-- Delete a single row
DELETE FROM matriculas
WHERE ID_Matricula = 6;

-- Remove all rows, but keep the table structure
TRUNCATE TABLE matriculas;

-- Remove tables entirely
-- CASCADE drops dependent foreign key constraints automatically
DROP TABLE alunos     CASCADE;
DROP TABLE cursos     CASCADE;
DROP TABLE matriculas;
```

### Quick reference: DELETE vs TRUNCATE vs DROP

| Command    | Removes rows | Removes table | Respects WHERE | Can rollback |
|------------|-------------|---------------|----------------|--------------|
| `DELETE`   | ✅           | ❌            | ✅             | ✅           |
| `TRUNCATE` | ✅           | ❌            | ❌             | ⚠️ depends   |
| `DROP`     | ✅           | ✅            | ❌             | ❌           |

